  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CfC - Coalitions for Change - NGP (National Governance Programme)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component aims to implement two provincial pilots in Sindh and Punjab that apply a Coalitions for Change (CfC) approach to addressing politically constrained governance reforms. Each pilot uses political analysis to identify a priority issue and supports influential coalitions with the power to deliver change, while simultaneously building the British High Commission&#x2019;s provincial capacity in politically informed and adaptive programming. Lessons from implementation will inform future UK governance support, including NGP&apos;s repurposing.</narrative>
  </description>
